window.products.push({"id":1112009,"name":"Easy Tuck (tm 300 Thread Count 100% Combed Cotton Sheet Set (White, Twin)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jqg502vJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why didn't they think of this before??? Cut your bed making time and effort in half! The Easy Tuck innovation is best described as a \"fitted\" self-centering top sheet. Finally, the functional elastic pockets of a fitted sheet are fused together with the draping properties of an oversized flat sheet. Here's how the patented design works: • Step 1 :Once the standard fitted bottom sheet is on the bed, the proprietary \"top sheet\" is tucked in at the bottom left and right corners. • Step 2 :Pull it up to the top. • Step 3 :Smooth your sheet, and you're done! The sides drape and fall evenly on both sides, creating a custom fit. This patented design eliminates the pain-inducing process of lifting a mattress to get a secure, fitted bed. Easy Tuck Bedding saves time and effort, changing what was once a chore into a quick 1-2-3 process! Easy Tuck is also great for active sleepers by keeping sheets centered and tucked under the bottom end of your mattress. No more messy beds! Woven of the highest quality 100 % Combed Cotton, these 300 thread count sheets are mercerized and beautifully finished to give you the softest, most luxurious sleep experience. The sets include a fitted bottom sheet, the innovative flat sheet and two pillow cases (Twin sets have one pillowcase). The pockets on the fitted bottom sheet should accommodate a deep mattress and pillow top up to 19 Inches: measure before you purchase for best results.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Jqg502vJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Easy Tuck","source_asin":"B00K62ZAFW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00K62ZAFW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00K62ZAFW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
