window.products.push({"id":1112452,"name":"Wild Goose Studio Art Celtic Cross Wall Hanging Love Cross Resin Cast Coated In Bronze 5 Inch Diameter Sturdy Ready To Hang Made in Ireland","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":50.93,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KS3odTqML._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Love is an important part of a happy, healthy home and this Irish wall décor Celtic love cross plaque gives love a place in your home decor as well as your heart. This detailed Ireland wall hanging features a cross in the center of a circle with intricate Celtic Knots in each corner. A sticker on the back explains the significance of each of these compartments, which symbolize the importance of the different parts of love. This Celtic Cross plaque design is crafted with resin and coated in a tarnish-resistant and durable bronze. The circular Ireland wall hanging measures approximately 5” in diameter and comes with a pre-drilled hole for easy hanging. This Celtic plaque makes a great housewarming gift or wedding present! It comes in a gift box to make gifting easy. This Celtic love cross plaque is crafted by the craftspeople at Wild Goose Studio in Kinsale, Co. Cork. Using resin and bronze, the craftspeople at Wild Goose craft meaningful Ireland wall decor that will bring the perfect Celtic touch to any home! Add this lovely Irish wall decor to your home today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KS3odTqML._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wild Goose","source_asin":"B007HBC0SK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112452","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B007HBC0SK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B007HBC0SK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
