window.products.push({"id":1112463,"name":"Fretech Table Runner Kitchen Decor, Home Decor, Kitchen Table, Outdoor Table, Coffee Dinner Table Runner, Easy to Clean, Heat Resistant (72Lx12W, Sand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BekxBooKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Welcome to MyFavstore: Our goal is to help every customer find an easy solution for their lives, with comfort, functionality and a lot of beauty. Our Mission is to inspire the creative spirit in each of us.  MyFavstore is committed to offering you high-quality products and we will try our best to serve you until you are satisfied with our service and products. If you have any question please feel free to contact us by message or e-mail and, we will reply to you within 24 hours. Description of the Table runners: - Material: 70% vinyl 30% Polyester; - Package Includes: 1 x Table Runner; - Color: Silver Grey, Ivory, Sandy Beige, Black, Navy Blue, Sky Blue, Forest Green, Gold. *Attention* Color is subjective. Each eye perceives it differently. The color of the product matches the image available on Amazon. We spent around 2 hours on each image retouching to make sure color is consistent across all colors available.  - Size About 120*30cm, 180*30cm, 270*30cm. Size can vary 1 inch more or less in the length. - Resistant and easy to clean: We just need a disinfectant product, a damp cloth, and in less than 10 seconds we have an immaculate (or clean) surface once again! Before any type of incident during the meal we don’t need to change tablecloths, soak them or add cloths underneath to avoid them spoiling the table: with a damp cloth we solve the problem quickly and carry on. In short, with non-stain placemats, we don’t need to think about machine washes while our children enjoy their glass of milk with chocolate (with more or fewer splashes); - Heat-Resistant: Effective heat-resistant protective table, up to 350ºF that is 177ºC.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91BekxBooKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fretech","source_asin":"B088F685DS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088F685DS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088F685DS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
