window.products.push({"id":1112509,"name":"Baby Gender Reveal Party Supplies Kit For Baby Boy Or Girl, Gender Reveal Decorations Boy or Girl Balloon, Baby Shower Decorations, Baby Reveal Props,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qcbszj5mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎈 A LOOK INSIDE - This baby gender reveal party supplies kit will include all the boy or girl gender reveal party supplies you'll want. Two banners, 36\" gender reveal balloons, blue and pink confetti, a fabulous sash for the mother-to-be, confetti balloons, an assortment of pink and blue latex balloons and photo booth props set to choose team girl or boy. Oh, and of course…our famous jumbo baby boy & girl balloons! Perfect for your baby reveal decorations ideas! 🎈 FUN AND MEMORABLE MOMENTS - Included in the baby reveal party supplies kit is a 20 piece gender reveal photo props set, together with the banners and sturdy balloons will make for a fun setup and includes all your needed gender reveal decorations for party. You can always post this gender reveal decorations kit on Instagram and tag us so we can see how much you've enjoyed your gender reveal party balloons! Also don’t forget the sash, it goes perfect with a proud mommy’s belly. 🎈BALLOON POPPERS - We won't let your gender reaveal surprise be spoiled! Our thick black gender reveal party supplies balloon will keep the secret till the right time, so you're able to capture the once in a lifetime moment. After a quick POP, boy or girl confetti with champagne gold sparks will shoot like a cannon, raining all over you and your guests. Don't forget to get it on camera! The gender reveal decor looks beautiful. 🎈WE CARE - Your baby reveal party decorations kit comes with 65 pieces and our signature gender reveal party decoration balloon with confetti, all carefully packaged in our impact and drop tested packaging. As soon as your pink and blue gender party supplies arrive, check them and tell us if anything is missing so we can replace it fast before your gender reveal parties. We guarantee fast customer service and only wish for our customer’s satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Qcbszj5mL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Valuri Creations","source_asin":"B07L1D2NYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07L1D2NYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07L1D2NYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1112510,"name":"SHUAXIN Paint by Numbers for Adults,Beginner Number Painting Kit with Full Acrylic Paint Set and 4 Brushes Romantic Rain Lover 16x20 Inch Frameless","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxfKE4TTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅COMPLETE DIY OIL PAINTING KIT:Our DIY kit contains everything you need to complete this delicate window flowers design oil painting,including 1 pre-printed linen canvas(without frame), a set of acrylic paints, 4 nylon brushes of different sizes, 1 reference picture of final works as well as 2 wall hooks and 2 screws to hang your finished painting. ✅EASY TO PAINT:The pre-printed textured canvas exactly shows where to paint each color.This paint by numbers kit is suitable for everyone,age and drawing skill does not matter.You only need to paint following the numbers in canvas,then you will create an excellent painting by yourself. ✅RELAXING AND JOYFUL:This DIY oil painting kit is a prefect choice to relax yourself.You can fully enjoy the pleasure of painting,relax your mind,release your pressure and cultivate your patience in the process of drawing.It is also a good way to enhance relationship if you paint together with others. ✅PERFECT DECORATION AND GIFT:The finished DIY painting looks like a professional artwork,and it can be kept for more than 10 years.So it is an excellent decoration for your home and office.Besides,this painting finished by yourself is absolutely a meaningful gift to your parents,lovers,children,friends,etc. ✅DISTINGUISH \"FRAMELESS\" AND \"WOODEN FRAMED\":Please note\"frameless\"means this kit does not include a frame,so you need to separately buy a wooden frame and fix the canvas on it so as to hang your painting. \"Wooden framed\" means this kit includes a canvas which has been fixed on a wooden frame,so you can hang it directly once finish painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VxfKE4TTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShuaXin","source_asin":"B01IJKGQC8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IJKGQC8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IJKGQC8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
