window.products.push({"id":1112794,"name":"BELDINEST Handmade Hammered Red Copper Serving Teapot Tea Kettle (Tunisia)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713FJWoHOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing makes a better centerpiece than a ravishing real copperteapot, hand hammered for an elegant finish. The red kettle has abody glistening with hand hammered/ hand carved traditionalabstract floral designs that stand upon four beautiful ornamentallegs. The handle and the pouring hose on the Moroccan tea pot isbrass beautifully hand crafted with such elegance and precision.The uses of this oriental tea kettle can be many. Product Features: Worldstock Country: Tunisia Material: Copper Set Include: 1 Piece Care Instruction: Hand Wash Color: Red Story Behind the Art:Behind every brass work of art is team of skillful Tunisianartisans. These men have been doing their work ever since they wereyoung. Their experience is unmatched. The precision and craftinessrequired to produce these ravishing works is exceptional. Theirworkshop is located in the heart of one of the main Medina Souks ofTunisia. They are at the epicenter of all the culture. Every workof art from the shop is enriched with a traditional style. Everystyle, design, and blueprint, has been passed down for generations.The men can skillfully craft many works of brass from hand chiseledtrays,platters and brass teapots to copper bowls and ornaments.Mehriz, a member of the workshop, has grown up watching his fathergo to work creating wonderful works of brass and hammered copper..He himself has inherited the talent, and now leads the team. ForMehriz, crafting these items is like playing an instrument. Thesound of metal chiseling and being hammered is music to his ears.Mehriz crafts with such rhythm and flow, he is fully indulged increating his functional pieces of art. We thank Overstock forgiving the opportunity to these artisans to broaden their horizons,expand their shop, and employ more people, and share their talentswith the customers of Overstock. What is Worldstock?The handcrafted nature of this product will produce minordifferences in design and sizing. Subtle variations will occur frompiece to pi","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713FJWoHOQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeldiNest","source_asin":"B017UX41YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017UX41YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017UX41YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
