window.products.push({"id":1112895,"name":"DECSPAS Easter Decorations for The Home，Wood Easter Bunny Truck Ornaments Easter Decor, Easter Bunny Welcome Sign Easter Door Decorations for Front Do","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpCElaDEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🐇【Easter Decorations】 - DECSPAS Easter wall decor consists of three parts of Easter ornaments. The first part is one white Easter bunny with two blue rabbits. The second part is a carrot that seems to have been chewed. The third one is big blue truck loaded with carrots and a cute bunny. “Easter” “BUNNY” “Welcome” are displayed separately on each layer. Adorable look makes it a lovely addition to your Easter home party decorations. 🥚【Strengthen Festival Atmosphere】 - Combined with bright color and vibrant objects, this farmhouse Easter decor could bring fresh feelings to your decorative places. In folklore, bunny carries colored eggs in its basket, as well as candy, and sometimes toys, to the homes of children. Adorn front door, the wall of entryway or the wall beyond dessert table to create a stunning Easter corner. Who knows, maybe a rabbit full of gifts will be attracted to your home. 🐥【Ideal Size】 - Measuring 13 x 24.4 x 0.4 inches, this Easter home decor works well to add a whimsical and unique touch to your home settings. Vivid color and fabulous woodcarving allow it to be an eye-catching accent. Just hang on the door, wall, fireplace, living room, bedroom, window, kitchen, dining room, entryway, nursery, etc. It’s perfect as an Easter accessory. Complete your home decor with full of energy and beauty. 🌷【Premium Material】 - This Easter Bunny decor is made of solid wooden material which is non-toxic, no odor, non-broken and safe to use. Careful polish creates smooth surface without burrs. The ink printed on these Easter decorations for the home is nice to avoid erasing the fonts. Strong jute rope makes stable suspension. Excellent craftsmanship gives this Easter wreath durability and extends its service life. 🚗【Wonderful Gift Choice】 - Benefit from their Easter-themed design, these Easter decorations outdoor are perfect as Easter gifts. Set your mind at rest to give it to your family, lover, friends, classmates, colleagues to show your warmth. Its distinctive appearance would speak volumes of your taste in art. To bless people happiness, health and richness, bring the joy of Easter gathering. Be sure to delight people year after year!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpCElaDEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECSPAS","source_asin":"B09N3R849H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112895","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N3R849H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N3R849H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
