window.products.push({"id":1112920,"name":"Reefer-Galler NO Moth Closet Hanger Refills - Kills Clothes Moths, Carpet Beetles, Eggs & Larvae (2 Moth Cakes, Pack of 6)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SBu1-MviL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REEFER GALLER NO MOTH CLOSET HANGER REFILLS: These moth cakes are great for hanging storage, like air-tight closets and garment bags. Keep your delicate woolens safe from moths without the scent of moth balls or the mess of moth crystals. When moth cakes have dissipated, replace with new cake. Reefer Galler Moth Cake Refills are available to protect clothing and other stored items against fabric eating pests. KILLS CLOTHES MOTHS AND CARPET BEETLES AND THEIR EGGS & LARVAE: Reefer Galler moth preventatives help prevent costly damage from insects. Reefer Galler moth balls, moth hangers, moth cakes, and moth spray kill clothing moths, moth eggs, moth larvae, carpet beetles, carpet beetle eggs and carpet beetle larvae, when used in air-tight containers. They are designed for long term or seasonal storage, like closets, drawers, blanket chests, sweater boxes and trunks for worry free moth protection. NO CLINGING ODOR: These moth balls provide great protection for your clothing without the clinging odor that original moth balls leave. SAY GOODBYE TO INDOOR BUG PROBLEMS: Flies, bees, cockroaches, moths, and mosquitos all have one thing in common - they aren't welcome in your home. Keep your home pest-free with Reefer-Galler bug repellent products. Fighting an infestation isn't easy, let Reefer-Galler help if you've been pleased with Terro, Permethrin, Raid, Sawyer, Bug Stop and EcoSMART. WILLERT HOME PRODUCTS: Willert Home Products began in 1946 with a single moth repellant product. Still owned and operated by the Willert family, we make over 100 home cleaning supplies and pest control items, including Ty-D-Bol, Bowl Fresh, airBOSS, Enoz and Reefer-Galler.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SBu1-MviL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Reefer-Galler","source_asin":"B07BL5RFNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112920","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BL5RFNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BL5RFNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
