window.products.push({"id":1112956,"name":"CRU by Darbie Angell Madison's April in NY 5 Piece Place Setting Dinnerware Set, Sea Blue/Pink/Platinum/White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TmbgmIacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The beauty of this collection came from the glowing 14 year old Madison who bravely fought Leukemia. Madison always wanted to visit NYC. Sadly her life was cut way too short, but in this collection Madison will always be remembered through the gorgeous cherry blossom branches that ironically cover Madison Park. A percentage of the proceeds for each piece go to pediatric cancer research. I hope you will help me in the fight!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91TmbgmIacL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Darbie Angell","source_asin":"B01A57X6JO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112956","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01A57X6JO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01A57X6JO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1112957,"name":"Le Creuset Enameled Cast Iron Tatin Dish, 2 Quart, Cerise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":166.06,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YF9HJgnEL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"Product Description Named for the famous French upside-down dessert, the Heritage Tart Tatin dish is crafted from our legendary enameled cast iron. Designed not only for tart tatin, this dish is an excellent choice for a variety of recipes such as pizza, quiche and traditional pie recipes. The superior heat distribution of enameled cast iron produces perfect results, while the porcelain enamel requires no seasoning, minimizes sticking and is dishwasher-safe. Amazon.com Designed specifically for preparing pastry-topped dishes like tarte Tatin that start on the stovetop, finish in the oven, and then must be flipped onto a platter for serving, this round, 9-3/4-inch, 2-inch-deep pan is versatile enough to be used in many ways. It's ideal for deep-dish pies, cakes, and quiches. And because it's safe on any stovetop, including induction, it can brown and sauté foods. Large, flat handles on the sides facilitate flipping pastry-topped dishes and permit the pan to be carried ceremoniously to the table. A recipe booklet accompanying the pan recounts the tale of tarte Tatin's accidental invention. The pan is made of cast iron, with both exterior and interior clad in two coats of Le Creuset's famous bright enamel. As cast iron is unexcelled for heat distribution and retention and enamel is impervious to acids and odors, the pan cooks food evenly and gently without hot spots and can be used for marinating. It's also dishwasher-safe. Like all Le Creuset cast-iron cookware, the pan is hand cast in a one-of-a-kind sand mold and hand finished at the Le Creuset factory in France. It carries a lifetime warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YF9HJgnEL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B0C3MRXK4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112957","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3MRXK4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3MRXK4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1112958,"name":"BreezyLife Aztec Throw Pillow Cover Geometric Decorative Pillow Case Square Linen Cushion Covers for Sofa Couch Farmhouse Outdoor Housewarming Gift 18","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dcva8WveL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BreezyLife decorative pillow cover is an original design which featuring stylish and classical aztec pattern on natural linen background. As an unique home decor, this cushion cover would be a great addition to your living room and bedroom, and also, it's a perfect gift for festival, party, housewarming and many other occasions, for both indoor and outdoor use. Product details: Material: 100% high weight cotton & linen blended fabric Size: 18 x 18 inches/45x45 cm Print: printed pattern on the front side ONLY Closure: side gliding smoothly hidden zipper for an easy removal Package included: 1Pc Cushion Cover WHITHOUT pillow insert Care Instructions: Wash in cold water at gentle cycle. Do not use bleach. Dry flat or hang to dry. Iron upside down at medium high (cotton) temperature with medium steam. Note: *All pillow covers do NOT come with the insert. *The colors may vary slightly depending on computer screen settings. *The background of the pillow cover is a kind of original linen beige, NOT pure white. *The printed pattern is available on front side ONLY, back is cotton & linen beige color WITHOUT printing. *To ensure a snug fit and plumper looking pillow, all covers are sewn approx 1/2 inch (1.3cm)smaller than actual size of pillow, which is the industrial standard. 100% LIFETIME GUARANTEE For any reason you're not completely satisfied, return the pillow cover for a replacement or full refund, no question asked.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dcva8WveL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BreezyLife","source_asin":"B075LK6NLB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075LK6NLB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075LK6NLB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1112959,"name":"Generic Deluxe Glass Marinade Turkey Meat Beef Poultry Baster 11 Inch 3 Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-tw+dn0RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Keep that roast or turkey nice and juicy by basting during cooking. This glass baster can take the heat of bubbling pan juices without melting or cracking. Holds 2 ounces. There is no better smell in the kitchen than a good turkey or ham while it roasts in the oven, steaming in its own juices. There is no better smell in the kitchen than a good turkey or ham while it roasts in the oven, steaming in its own juices. Every time someone walks by, they breathe in and enjoy the scent of the dinner that is coming up. Every time someone walks by, they breathe in and enjoy the scent of the dinner that is coming up. However, to keep that dish as moist as you need it, the key is to keep basting. However, to keep that dish as moist as you need it, the key is to keep basting. The Good Living baster helps you coat your delicious dish flavorful without drying out as it cooks. The Good Living baster helps you coat your delicious dish flavorful without drying out as it cooks. The rubber grip makes it easy to hold on as you suction some of the juices in the pan and then let it drip over the meat. The rubber grip makes it easy to hold on as you suction some of the juices in the pan and then let it drip over the meat. Every guest at the table will be grateful for your dedication to this dish when it comes time to divvy up the servings. Every guest at the table will be grateful for your dedication to this dish when it comes time to divvy up the servings. Add this utensil to your kitchenware to keep your meats nice and moist every time. Add this utensil to your kitchenware to keep your meats nice and moist every time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-tw+dn0RL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B071RVNWVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071RVNWVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071RVNWVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
