window.products.push({"id":1112991,"name":"HomEquip 17 Oz Olive Oil Glass Dispenser Pump with Measuring Cup (1Pk): Drip Free Pouring Spout Bottle - For Olive Oil, Herb Oils, Vinegar & Salad Liq","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KOzhyS34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About HomEquip: We are a recognized kitchen line with a long, successful history of versatile kitchen essentials. We created a cohesive collections through style, quality, and practicality. We love to make your cooking experience simple & fun. We now offer a variety of innovative kitchen gadgets that will enhance your kitchen experience. From oil presses, organizers, glass jars, and home brew bottles makes your kitchen feel tidy & neat. Versatile Uses: Our multi-function glass vinegar and oil dispenser is the ultimate solution for low fat diets like 21 day fix diet. Use for oil, homemade vinaigrette, soy sauce and any other liquid, you need to measure while cooking or baking. Great for herb infused oil or making your favorite salad dressing recipes or creamer. May be used professionally for restaurants & deli takeout’s as salad dressing dispensers. The ultimate liquid extractor for all your cooking needs! Keep your Kitchen Clean: No-drip spout prevents dripping or spillage to keep the outside of the bottle and countertops mess-free. The glass is dishwasher safe, but the other parts are recommended to hand wash. 100% Satisfactory Quality: Made with durable glass, stainless steel center and silicon & BPA-free plastic spout for your quality assurance. Precise Measuring: Cover includes teaspoon (tsp), tablespoon (tbsp) and milliliter (ml) labels for precise measuring. Efficient pressure chamber pump for smooth operation and nozzle for portion control. Don’t over dress your salad or mistakenly pour too much oil when cooking by pumping a premeasured amount of oil before pouring. Super Value: Conveniently comes in two different capacity sizes: 8.5 oz / 250 ml & 17oz / 500 ml. Enjoy the economical benefit of our reusable glass oil pump dispenser. Our pricing can’t be beat by anyone, compare to other brands in this category.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KOzhyS34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEQUIP","source_asin":"B01MYWFMRK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1112991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYWFMRK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYWFMRK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
